<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:760px"><div class="section-head" style="text-align:left;margin-bottom:24px"><h1>{% case policy.handle %}{% when 'privacy-policy' %}Privacy Policy{% when 'refund-policy' %}Refund Policy{% when 'shipping-policy' %}Shipping Policy{% when 'terms-of-service' %}Terms of Service{% else %}{{ policy.title }}{% endcase %}</h1></div><div class="policy-body">{% case policy.handle %}{% when 'privacy-policy' %}
<p>Last updated: October 6, 2026.</p>
<p>FURVERO ("we", "our") operates this store. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit or buy from our store, and how we use it.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<p><strong>Order information:</strong> when you place an order, we collect your name, email address, shipping address, and payment details needed to process and deliver your order. Payment information is processed securely by our payment providers; we do not store full card numbers.</p>
<p><strong>Contact information:</strong> when you write to us through the contact form, we receive your name, email address, and the contents of your message.</p>
<p><strong>Device information:</strong> we automatically collect basic technical data such as your browser type, device, and pages visited, including through cookies required for the store to function (cart, checkout, preferences).</p>
<h2>How we use your information</h2>
<p>We use your information to process and deliver orders, provide tracking updates, respond to your messages, prevent fraud, and improve our store. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>We share information only as needed to run the store: with Shopify (our ecommerce platform), payment processors, and shipping carriers such as the fulfillment service that delivers your order.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information by contacting us through the <a href="/pages/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy from time to time. The current version will always be posted on this page.</p>
{% when 'refund-policy' %}
<p>We want you to love Furvero. If you don't, you can return it.</p>
<h2>30-day returns</h2>
<p>You have 30 days from the date of delivery to request a return. To be eligible, the item should be in its original condition and packaging.</p>
<h2>How to start a return</h2>
<p>Write to us through the <a href="/pages/contact">contact page</a> with your order number and the reason for the return. We will reply with the return instructions.</p>
<h2>Refunds</h2>
<p>Once we receive and inspect the returned item, we will issue your refund to the original payment method. Please allow a few business days for the refund to appear on your statement, depending on your bank or card issuer.</p>
<h2>Return shipping</h2>
<p>Return shipping costs are the customer's responsibility unless the item arrived damaged or incorrect — in that case, we cover them.</p>
{% when 'shipping-policy' %}
<p>We currently ship within the United States.</p>
<h2>Delivery times</h2>
<p>Estimated delivery: <strong>5–11 days</strong> from the date your order ships. Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees — delays can occur.</p>
<h2>Tracking</h2>
<p>A tracking number is provided by email when available, so you can follow your order.</p>
<h2>Shipping costs</h2>
<p>Shipping costs, if any, are shown at checkout before you pay. We do not add hidden shipping fees.</p>
{% when 'terms-of-service' %}
<p>Last updated: October 6, 2026.</p>
<p>By visiting or purchasing from the FURVERO store, you agree to these Terms of Service.</p>
<h2>Products</h2>
<p>We describe our products honestly and do our best to display them accurately. Product availability and prices may change without notice. We reserve the right to limit quantities and to refuse or cancel any order, including in cases of pricing errors or suspected fraud.</p>
<h2>Orders and payment</h2>
<p>When you place an order, you agree to provide accurate contact, shipping, and payment information. Your order is confirmed once payment is successfully processed.</p>
<h2>Shipping and returns</h2>
<p>Shipping times and our return policy are described in our <a href="/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a> and <a href="/policies/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>, which form part of these terms.</p>
<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
<p>You agree not to misuse this store — including attempting to disrupt its operation, submitting false information, or using it for unlawful purposes.</p>
<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
<p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, FURVERO is not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or store. Our total liability is limited to the amount you paid for the product in question.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the store after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about these terms? Reach us through the <a href="/pages/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
{% else %}
{{ policy.body }}
{% endcase %}</div></div></section>
